    "en": {
      "trackName": "25 Mini Games: Watch & Phone",
      "description": "Jump into a bright arcade bundle packed with quick challenges, simple controls, and different game styles. Play action, puzzle, sports, and reflex-based mini games in one place, unlock more content over time, and keep switching between experiences whenever you want a fresh run.\n\nLots of mini games for your watch and phone.\n\n25 Mini Games Collection includes a unique combination of games. Play offline - no internet connection required for playing.\n\nPlay right away:\n- Ping Pong (up to four players on one device!)\n- Tic Tac Toe\n- Saw Master! Ultimate\n\nPlay right away on mobile, unlock on watch:\n- Chess\n- Gold Ninja\n- Color Sort Fun\n- Cowboy Duel\n- Goal Keeper Fantastico\n- Tunnel Racer\n- Tunnel Racer 2.0\n- Zombie Goats\n- Cactus vs. Dino 3D: Jump game\n- Moto Race: Oncoming Fury\n- Dino Merge: Idle Clicker\n- Mediocre Manfredo: Jump'n'run\n- Night Racer: Car Crash\n- Super Flags! Flag Quiz\n- Super Maps! Map Quiz\n- Four in a Row\n- Monster Truck: Car Smash\n- Battle Run: Castle\n- Tech Billionaire Jump\n- Tunnel Dig: Red Sapphire Quest\n- Cactus Run\n- Nodoku: It's not Sudoku\n- Tech Billionaire Run\n\nThat's right - those are actually 26 games!",
